screen.distantHorizons=Kaugemad horisondid
option.dhOverdrawDistance=Ülekattumise kaugus
option.dhOverdrawDistance.comment=How far beyond the camera Distant Horizons keeps rendering terrain, in blocks. Higher values let distant terrain keep their detail for longer.
option.dhOverdrawFadeLength=Ülekattumise hääbumise pikkus
option.dhOverdrawFadeLength.comment=Distance over which the Distant Horizons overdraw fades out, in blocks. It blends the extra terrain into the normal render distance.
option.noiseOnDhTerrain=Mürastatud maastik
option.noiseOnDhTerrain.comment=Adds fine noise to Distant Horizons terrain so it does not look unnaturally smooth. It costs a little extra performance.

option.slantedRain=Kaldvihm
option.slantedRain.comment=Kaldvihma osakesed. Muudab vihmase ilma veidi atmosfäärilisemaks
option.endGlow=Endi helendus
option.endGlow.comment=Võbelevalt helendav efekt Endis. Vajab ruumilist udu (Volumetric Fog)
option.aoInSunlight=AO päikesevalguses
option.aoInSunlight.comment=Kas rakendada varjutuse shaderit otsese päikese-/kuuvalguse korral
option.ssaoRadius=SSAO raadius
option.ssaoRadius.comment=Reguleerib SSAO raadiust – kaugust, mille jooksul objektid saavad teineteist varjutada
option.ssaoSteps=SSAO sammud
option.ssaoSteps.comment=Number of samples used by the screen-space ambient occlusion. More samples give a smoother result but cost more performance.
option.gtaoRadius=GTAO raadius
option.gtaoRadius.comment=Reguleerib GTAO raadiust – kaugust, mille jooksul objektid saavad teineteist varjutada
option.gtaoHorizonSteps=GTAO horisondi sammud
option.gtaoHorizonSteps.comment=Määrab GTAO täpsuse
option.lightningFlash=Välgusähvatus
option.lightningFlash.comment=Brightness of the flash the sky emits when lightning strikes. Higher values light up the whole scene for a moment.
option.endSunEffect=Päikeseefekt Endis
option.endSunEffect.comment=Draws the End's sun as a bright disc with a flare around it instead of the flat vanilla sun.
option.mistModeOff=Off
option.mistModeBasic=Basic
option.mistModeAdvanced=Advanced
option.airFogCloudyNoise=Pilvine udu
option.airFogCloudyNoise.comment=Õrnad pilvelaadse kujuga udud, kõige paremini nähtavad hommikul.\nVajab mahulist udu!
option.normalMapping=Normaalkaardistus
option.normalMapping.comment=Kas kasutada ressursipaki normaalkaarte. Lülita sisse, kui kasutad PBR‑põhist ressurssipakki
option.specularMapping=Spekulaarkaardistus
option.specularMapping.comment=Kas kasutada ressurssipaki spekulaarkaarte. Lülita sisse PBR‑pakiga
option.hardcodedSpecular=Kauakodeeritud spekulaarsus
option.hardcodedSpecular.comment=Teatud plokkide (nt metalli) spekulaarkaarte on eelnevalt kooditud
option.hardcodedSss=Kauakodeeritud SSS
option.hardcodedSss.comment=Teatud plokkide (nt lehed) nahaalune hajumine on eelnevalt kooditud
option.vanillaAoLift=Vanilla AO Lift
option.vanillaAoLift.comment=Lifts the darkest vanilla AO shadows toward flat lighting. Higher = shallower, more washed-out crevices; 0 = full-depth vanilla AO.
option.displayGamutSrgb=sRGB
option.displayGamutDciP3=DCI-P3
option.displayGamutDisplayP3=Display P3
option.displayGamutRec2020=Rec.2020
option.displayGamutAdobeRgb=Adobe RGB
option.porosity=Porosity
option.porosity.comment=Enables porous blocks, which absorb light and darken where they touch other blocks. The strength and the data source are set by the porosity options below.
option.sss=Sub-Surface Scattering
option.sss.comment=Enables subsurface scattering, where light bleeds through thin blocks such as leaves or grass. The brightness and the data source are set by the SSS options below.
